name: grok-faf-elite
version: 1.0.0
description: Instant AI context for your repos. One-click FAF builder with Rust WASM generation + Zig WASM scoring. F1-Inspired Elite Edition.
ai_readiness: 98%
tech_stack:
  framework: SvelteKit 5
  language: TypeScript (strict)
  styling: Tailwind CSS 4
  deployment: Cloudflare Workers
  wasm: Rust (211KB generator) + Zig (2.7KB scorer)
architecture:
  pattern: Component-based SPA
  state: Svelte 5 runes ($state, $props, $effect)
  routing: SvelteKit file-based routing
features:
  - One-click .faf generation for any GitHub repo
  - Rust WASM generator (211KB, ~3ms generation)
  - Zig WASM scorer (2.7KB, ~14μs scoring, 71K scores/sec)
  - OAuth GitHub integration for commits
  - Real-time scoring (0-100% AI-readiness)
  - Download or commit directly to repo
  - Native dialog modals for accessibility
components:
  BigOrange: Animated logo with hover effects
  ActionButton: Reusable button with icon snippets
  Modal: Native dialog-based accessible modal
performance_targets:
  bundle_size: <20 kB gzipped
  build_time: <5s
  first_paint: <100ms
integrations:
  - grok-faf-mcp (npm package)
  - MCP server at https://mcpaas.live/grok/mcp/v1
commands:
  dev: npm run dev
  build: npm run build
  check: npm run check
  preview: npm run preview
  test: npm run test
